<title>NEW ZEALAND: Broadway posts don't sell notice.</title>
<headline>Broadway posts don't sell notice.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Directors of industrial holding company Broadway Industries Ltd on Tuesday issued a don't sell notice pending an announcement expected early next week.</p>
<p>Broadway last traded at NZ$1.05.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
